{"data":{"videos":[{"id":"cmq2lzkaz7gvui9cp7it7pf8g","bgmId":354700,"categoryId":null,"name":"吉伊卡哇","slug":"video-5054","sub":"小可爱 / Chiikawa","nameEn":null,"nameOriginal":null,"pic":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/c9/b1/354700_S6YP6.jpg","picThumb":null,"director":"三原武宪,北川隆之,佐藤雅子,木村宽","actor":"青木遥,田中诚人,小泽亚李,井口裕香,杉田智和,东地宏树,松冈祯丞,内田雄马,浅井孝行","writer":null,"studio":null,"blurb":null,"content":"<p>　　由ナガノ氏在推特上連載的漫畫《吉伊卡哇》，宣布將於2022年推出動畫，作品由動畫工房擔綱製作。《吉伊卡哇》是描述一群可愛小動物們的日常物語，作中的小動物們必須從事拔草或討伐等工作以換取報酬，描繪獨具個性的角色們在一起所展開的日常趣事。作品並推出有各式各樣的文具、日用周邊商品，受到許多人喜愛。</p>","remarks":"更新至第121集","tag":null,"area":"日本","lang":"日语","year":2022,"season":null,"total":null,"episodeCount":121,"serial":true,"status":1,"score":0,"scoreCount":0,"hits":294,"hitsDay":9,"hitsWeek":19,"hitsMonth":274,"airStatus":null,"weekday":null,"weekdayTime":null,"publishedAt":null,"mergedIntoId":null,"createdAt":"2026-06-06T17:10:14.412Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T05:00:17.361Z","category":null,"_count":{"playSources":3,"comments":0}},{"id":"cmp2x43c91lbai9m8so6z3kdu","bgmId":null,"categoryId":null,"name":"代号Qualidea","slug":"qualidea","sub":"クオリディア・コード","nameEn":null,"nameOriginal":null,"pic":"https://wework.qpic.cn/wwpic3az/187599_4YIlENNdSuCukFA_1725909545/300","picThumb":null,"director":null,"actor":null,"writer":null,"studio":null,"blurb":null,"content":"故事发生在在人类与敌人“Unknown”持续战争的世界。数十年前“Unknown”侵略时被送往冷冻睡眠设施避难的孩子们，从沉睡中醒来之时，得知自己的身体中被发现了超自然的力量——世界。为了从出现在东京湾的“Unknown”手中保护国家，少年少女们在东京、神奈川、千叶的各防卫都市展开战斗。东京由相乐总、神奈川由橘公司、千叶由渡航担当，创造出“QUALIDEA”的世界。","remarks":"全12集","tag":"动画,动作冒险","area":"日本","lang":"日语","year":2016,"season":null,"total":12,"episodeCount":12,"serial":false,"status":1,"score":0,"scoreCount":0,"hits":72,"hitsDay":28,"hitsWeek":72,"hitsMonth":72,"airStatus":null,"weekday":null,"weekdayTime":null,"publishedAt":null,"mergedIntoId":null,"createdAt":"2026-05-12T17:41:59.145Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-25T00:05:01.261Z","category":null,"_count":{"playSources":1,"comments":0}},{"id":"cmp2ycf8z04jli9az9lzv76em","bgmId":414590,"